@FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5210
@adminToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@userToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...
@familyId = 265063bd-efbf-4d54-93c0-4c9b634de51f
@targetUserId = a50b0f89-40c3-464e-a9e6-2c47e5564419
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 1. Health check & Smoke Test
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/
Accept: application/json

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE AUTENTICACIÓN (Solo Login y Refresh Token)
### ========================================================

### 2. Iniciar sesión (Super Admin / Usuario)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "0995929826",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "installationId": "pixel-8-pro-instalacion-001",
  "deviceModel": "Pixel 8 Pro",
  "fcmToken": "ken_fcm_token"
}

### 3. Renovar Token (Refresh Token)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN",
  "installationId": "pixel-8-pro-instalacion-001",
  "deviceModel": "Pixel 8 Pro",
  "fcmToken": "ken_fcm_token"
}

### 3b. Cerrar sesión (revoca el refresh token en el servidor)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "REPLACE_WITH_REFRESH_TOKEN",
  "allDevices": false
}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE PERFIL DE USUARIO
### ========================================================

### 4. Consultar Mi Perfil (Muestra SystemRole y familias con FamilyRole)
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 5. Actualizar Mi Número de Teléfono
PATCH {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/phone
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newPhoneNumber": "0995929826",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### 5b. Borrar mi historial de ubicaciones (derecho de supresión)
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/me/history
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 6. Actualizar Mi Contraseña
PATCH {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/me/password
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "Password123*",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword456*"
}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE SUPER ADMINISTRADOR (users.role = 'admin')
### ========================================================

### 7. Super Admin: Listar Todos los Usuarios de la Plataforma
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 8. Super Admin: Consultar Usuario por ID
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 9. Super Admin: Crear Usuario Asignando FamilyId Obligatorio
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlos",
  "lastName": "Gomez",
  "phoneNumber": "+593977777777",
  "password": "Password123*",
  "familyId": "{{familyId}}",
  "familyRole": "admin"
}

### 10. Super Admin: Modificar Usuario / Reasignar Familia
PATCH {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Carlos Alberto",
  "familyId": "{{familyId}}",
  "familyRole": "member"
}

### 11. Super Admin: Eliminar Usuario del Sistema
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/users/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE FAMILIAS (Super Admin & Admin Familiar)
### ========================================================

### 12. Super Admin: Crear Nueva Familia
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Familia Castro"
}

### 13. Listar Familias (Super Admin ve todas; Usuario normal solo las suyas)
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. Obtener Detalle de Familia por ID
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 15. Super Admin: Modificar Nombre de Familia
PATCH {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Familia Castro Actualizada"
}

### 16. Super Admin: Eliminar Familia en Cascada
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 17. Admin Familiar: Crear y Dar de Alta un Pariente Directamente en la Familia
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Juanito",
  "lastName": "Castro",
  "phoneNumber": "+593988888123",
  "password": "Password123*"
}

### 18. Admin Familiar: Vincular Usuario Preexistente por Teléfono
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members/link
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phoneNumber": "+593988888889",
  "role": "member"
}

### 19. Admin Familiar: Modificar Rol de un Miembro ('admin' o 'member')
PATCH {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}/role
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "admin"
}

### 20. Expulsar Miembro o Salir del Grupo
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/families/{{familyId}}/members/{{targetUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE DISPOSITIVOS
### ========================================================

### 21. Actualizar Token FCM del Dispositivo Activo
PATCH {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/fcm-token
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fcmToken": "nuevo_fcm_token_rotado"
}

### 22. Desvincular / Eliminar Dispositivo (Super Admin o Propietario)
DELETE {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/devices/{{deviceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### ========================================================
### MÓDULO DE LOCALIZACIÓN ON-DEMAND (FCM & SIGNALR)
### ========================================================

### 23. Solicitar Ubicación On-Demand (Silent Push vía FCM)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/request
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "familyId": "{{familyId}}",
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

### 24. Reportar Coordenadas GPS (En respuesta al despertar por Silent Push)
POST {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/report
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "latitude": -0.180653,
  "longitude": -78.467834
}

### 25. Consultar Última Ubicación de un Familiar
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/families/{{familyId}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/latest
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 26. Consultar Historial de Ubicaciones
GET {{FindMyFamily.Api_HostAddress}}/api/locations/families/{{familyId}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/history?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}
Accept: application/json
